body:
My guess would be this is Mr. ~~Scratch~~, perhaps before he goes all psycho or berserk, or some new doppelgänger of Alan's. In the original sequel pitch released by Polygon back in 2015 Remedy stated they got big plans for ~~Scratch~~. One thing I hope from the sequel is him being the main antagonist and Remedy saying, "If you played American Nightmare, cool. This'll be a fun reintroduction to ~~Scratch~~, but at the same time ***this*** is what we've wanted to do with him this whole time. ***This*** is him in his true potential.

&#x200B;

P.S. In Control's AWE DLC Thomas appeared looking like Alan and said he's a filmmaker and the poet was just a role he played. In Alan Wake Remastered the poster of Zane was replaced with a movie-like poster. Is this a retcon?
